&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have experience operating at a global company, and relative fluency with Japan (and other APAC region) specific HR and employment policies and best practices&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have worked at a tech company, start-up, or a similarly fast-paced environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in Japanese and English&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong candidates may also:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Care deeply when it comes to helping and supporting a diverse set of people at all levels of an organization, excelling in supporting employees and managers to do their best work&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have proven experience and skill sets in providing confidential, practical support and are trained in topics like conflict resolution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have strong working knowledge of human-resource-related best practices and are able to effectively implement these in a culturally appropriate fashion&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be a pragmatic problem-solver and enjoy developing creative solutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thrive in building and scaling processes, and enjoy identifying and setting up new systems at a quickly growing company&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
