&lt;li&gt;Proactively research and identify businesses that are a strong fit for &lt;strong&gt;Secret Media Network’s &lt;/strong&gt;audience and content channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct high volume outbound outreach across email, calls, LinkedIn, and other channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify inbound and outbound leads and schedule discovery calls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare thoughtfully for outreach and calls by understanding each prospect’s brand, industry, and marketing objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate and organized records of activity, pipeline, and follow ups in Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
