&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hey there! &lt;br&gt;We’re &lt;a href=&quot;https://feverup.com/&quot;&gt;Fever&lt;/a&gt;, the world’s leading tech platform for culture and live entertainment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission? To democratize access to culture and entertainment. With our proprietary cutting-edge technology and data-driven approach, we’re revolutionizing the way people engage with live entertainment. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every month, our platform inspires over 300 million people in +55 countries (and counting) to discover unforgettable experiences while also empowering event creators with our data and technology, helping them scale, innovate, and enhance their events to reach new audiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our results? We’ve teamed up with major industry leaders like Netflix, F.C. Barcelona, and Primavera Sound, presented international award-winning experiences, and are backed by several leading global investors! Impressive, right?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To achieve our mission, we are looking for bar-raisers with a hands-on mindset who are eager to help shape the future of entertainment!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to be part of the experience?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now, let’s discuss this role and what you will do to help achieve Fever’s mission.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As part of the &lt;strong&gt;Fever Originals team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will use data and insights to create one-of-a-kind events and experiences that allow people to have unforgettable moments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role of the Production Managers is to deliver the physical production elements of one of our big projects. They are responsible for ensuring that all aspects of production are managed at a local level. The role has a key responsibility in building close working relationships with local production partners and their teams. Production Managers are responsible for the load in and load out of the production and are responsible for ensuring projects are delivered safely and to schedule.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production Planning &amp;amp; Coordination
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the planning and execution of assigned production areas, ensuring alignment with the overall event strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate high-level production plans into actionable timelines and deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Infrastructure &amp;amp; Logistics, Operations, and other departments to ensure integrated planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supplier &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own relationships with key production suppliers and local partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all vendors deliver on scope, deadlines, and quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as escalation point for complex operational or supplier issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Infrastructure &amp;amp; Logistics Oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the execution of infrastructure and logistics plans within scope, including areas such as: fencing, temporary structures, machinery, transport, and site services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure proper coordination of load-in and load-out schedules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with logistics teams on equipment movement, warehousing, and on-site distribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On-Site Operations Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead on-site production teams during build-up, live event, and breakdown.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all operational plans are executed safely, efficiently, and to standard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as key point of contact for production topics on-site, coordinating across departments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Timeline &amp;amp; Delivery Control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and continuously update detailed production schedules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track milestones, identify risks, and proactively solve delays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all production areas within scope are aligned and delivered on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budget Ownership &amp;amp; Cost Control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage budgets for assigned production scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track costs, approve expenses, and ensure financial alignment with the overall budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify efficiencies and cost-saving opportunities without compromising quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and mentor Production Assistants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure clear delegation of responsibilities and strong team communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive accountability and performance across the production team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-8+ years of experience in large-scale event production or similar environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of infrastructure, logistics, and on-site event operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage suppliers, budgets, and complex timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on mindset with strong problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in high-pressure, fast-paced environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR HIRING PROCESS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 30 min video call with one of our Talent Acquisition Managers, to better understand your career plan, assess cultural fit, and answer any questions you may have&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 45 min video call with your future manager, including questions about your profile and a business case presentation (to be prepared in advance)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On average our process lasts 15 working days and offers usually follow within a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;#LI-Fulltime #LI-Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you for considering joining Fever. We cannot wait to learn more about you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to learn more about us: &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://newsroom.feverup.com/en-US/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://newsroom.feverup.com/en-UKI/208389-goldman-sachs-asset-management-leads-227m-investment-in-live-entertainment-tech-startup-fever&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Fever&#39;s Blog&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.eu/2023/02/02/fever-raises-110-million-in-new-round-at-1-8-billion-valuation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Tech.Eu&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2019/08/04/data-driven-events-discovery-and-planning-startup-fever-raises-35-million-led-by-rakuten/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2019/08/04/data-driven-events-discovery-and-planning-startup-fever-raises-35-million-led-by-rakuten/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;TechCrunch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fever is committed to creating an inclusive and diverse workspace where everyone&#39;s background and ideas count. Our main goal is to find the best possible talent regardless of place of birth, racial or ethnic origin, gender, gender identity, religion, opinion, sexual orientation, disability, pregnancy, marital status, age or caring responsibilities. We encourage everyone to apply!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you require any kind of accommodation during the selection process please contact our Talent team so we can help you by providing a welcoming and seamless journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to know more about how Fever processes your personal data, click here&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1cIzPP7QJGht5LAGKkRGQP8fxh-Z4Mfph2JhGSvhd8zM/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.y7rpsj7nzave&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Fever - Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

