&lt;p&gt;POSITION SUMMARY:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Transitional Care Director provides leadership and support for BAYADA’s Skilled Nursing Unit’s Transitional Care Program (TCP).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA’s Skilled Nursing &amp;nbsp;Unit (SNU) services provide high‑level, medically complex care in the home—delivered by highly trained nurses who support children and adults with serious or long‑term health needs&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt; Our skilled nursing teams manage everything from ventilators and tracheostomies to medication administration and rehabilitation‑related care, helping clients remain safe and independent at home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/DxScXOg6sdY?si=goqnSEGLWYAq7CQY&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MINIMUM QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exemplifies characteristics of &lt;em&gt;The BAYADA Way&lt;/em&gt;: compassion, excellence and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Four (4) year college degree in nursing, marketing or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formal sales training, with proven ability to develop and implement a sales and marketing plan &lt;em&gt;(Extensive operations experience in the skilled nursing home care space, coupled with ability to build relationships may be considered in lieu of a sales background)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Licensed Registered Nurse, strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in nursing, discharge planning or home care in a respective specialty (pediatrics, rehabilitation, etc.) with background in high tech and complex care management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of two (2) years verifiable supervisory or management experience in health care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated record of strong interpersonal skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to represent the company effectively in a variety of settings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read, write and effectively communicate in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PRIMARY RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate and communicate the core values of BAYADA Home Health Care and &lt;em&gt;The BAYADA Way&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide leadership and support for the design, development, implementation and management of the TCP Program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate training of transitional care managers, families and clients according to the TCP Playbook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for TCP metric management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TCP program development through promotion, market research, business development and strategic planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participates in company projects that support the TCP program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain relationships with key referral sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the communications office (COM) on new marketing materials, attend sales, marketing and educational events and explore promotional giveaways&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote BAYADA by providing educational presentations at facilities, payers and community by writing, packaging and presenting Continuing Education programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate meetings to promote teamwork among facility and service teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with BAYADA’s Managed Care offices, Insurance Confirmation office and the Contract Management office in the transition of clients home.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop annual marketing plan and initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand competition and the market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA believes that our employees are our greatest asset:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BAYADA offers a comprehensive benefits plan that includes the following: Paid holidays, vacation and sick leave, vision, dental and medical health plans, employer paid life insurance, 401k with company match, direct deposit and employee assistance program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To learn more about BAYADA Benefits, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bayada.com/benefits/&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
